<span style=3D"text-transform: none;">We put the english version. For your =
information, we intentionally limited the scope of the company in this firs=
t step. It is mainly distribution , stock and shipping of imported veterina=
ry test for sales in Europe. If we
 indicate, biotechnology activity, R&amp;D in diagnostic =A1=AD we risk to =
have a lag time between deposition of documents to the authority (ICS) and =
their authorisation to proceed in a sensible sector. For specific agreement=
s between parties a shareholder pact is better
 .</span></div>
